{"game": "the-first-descendant", "language": "english", "appid": 2074920, "month": "2025-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1741392000, "end_date": 1742083199, "month_true_total": 540, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-01 15:47:36 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "190306601", "author": {"steamid": "76561199382641023", "personaname": "R3", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199382641023/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 13102, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13102, "last_played": 1722695087, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "The transaction based nature of the game is hard to ignore, with aspects like inventory expansion and individual character unlocks behind paywalls. While the core mechanics and character abilities are enjoyable, the pushy monetization scheme detracts from the experience, leaving the impression that it's more cash grab than fulfilling quest", "timestamp_created": 1742079690, "timestamp_updated": 1742079690, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190299908", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018681573", "personaname": "Warrior", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198018681573/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 13194, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12731, "deck_playtime_at_review": 223, "last_played": 1772157774, "avatar": "148ff422f2245ab66abfeabf3f7506861d6b703b"}, "language": "english", "review": "could be good too many bugs", "timestamp_created": 1742074282, "timestamp_updated": 1746906017, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494784921407699585", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "190298677", "author": {"steamid": "76561199220084826", "personaname": "Silky_Maki_Bunny19", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199220084826/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6506, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5549, "last_played": 1768692196, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun", "timestamp_created": 1742073367, "timestamp_updated": 1742073367, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.467836260795593262", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190295972", "author": {"steamid": "76561199415480768", "personaname": "julian", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199415480768/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 951, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 641, "last_played": 1753560316, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "The performance issues with First Descendant make it nearly unplayable on my system. Terrible optimization across the board - constant frame drops and stuttering even on decent hardware. It runs like absolute garbage regardless of settings tweaks.\nThe powercreep is beyond ridiculous. New content consistently invalidates anything you've previously grinded for, making your time investment feel worthless. Speaking of grinding - the predatory microtransaction system is designed to frustrate you into paying. Basic quality-of-life features are paywalled while the free experience is deliberately tedious.\nThis game desperately wants to be Warframe but lacks all the charm and player-friendly systems that make that title work. First Descendant copied the aesthetics but completely missed what makes Warframe actually fun to play. Save your time and storage space - this one's a hard pass.", "timestamp_created": 1742071363, "timestamp_updated": 1742071378, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "190294871", "author": {"steamid": "76561199405449430", "personaname": "DakaraSpawn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199405449430/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4414, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4275, "last_played": 1746292216, "avatar": "b23e9c264d0a5a52f33afa7e073109cc313cd1eb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Better off playing it on console if you don't want the game crashing every half hour. From the release it's been the same. I gave it a wide birth for about 5 months. Downloaded it today and still the same thing. Uninstall instantly because really there is no point on PC. No space on console and now just can;t be bothered to even try. Was going to stream it, guess not. I hope you guys get this very little small but annoying enough issue sorted out one day. Many have problems and it's only this game. The same would and still happens on Destiny 1 so it can on;y be a swerver issue. Good luck!", "timestamp_created": 1742070563, "timestamp_updated": 1742070563, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}]}